lines=['# Vitalis’s D3 owner checkpoint — NSSCAS Mathematics 8227','','NIED December 2020 syllabus, Grade 12. Owner Vitalis; PLANNER Codex; 24 November 2026. **Pending: Claude confirms only D3 changes, then Vitalis approves the exact final manifest.** OD-1–6 bind. No Stage E before explicit approval.','','Read `../checks/plan-repair-d3-report.md`, `../PLAN.md`, the contract and subject rules, nine work orders and 42 worked examples. `plan-manifest.json` pins the candidate. All 809 D2 files and earlier D0/D1 candidates are recoverable under history.','','| Matter | Exact D3 candidate and limits | Owner answer |','|---|---|---|','| Counts | 9 recipes, 14 choices, 42 paper cases, 27 assessed slots; no runtime instances | Pending Vitalis |','| Bloom | 13 Apply, 1 Analyse; both stationary branches Apply; mixed motion supports its own Analyse demand | Pending exact-rubric acceptance |','| Coverage | 38 unconditional facets plus 1 conditional-only; objectives 26/60 = 25 unconditional plus M1:T6:O03 conditional-only. All 138 demands / 67 groups / 8 supplementary entries accounted; 99 content demands outside pilot | Pending scope acceptance |','| Motion domain and freshness | Polynomial 137 tasks / 35 first-part contexts; exponential 56 / 14; mixed 168 = 144 sign-change + 24 no-change, 28 shapes, minority 1/7. Whole-fresh bounds 35/14/168; preserve model and version-key aliases | Pending exact domain |','| Trapezium | 30 mathematical presentations, 11 contexts, mathematical packing 3; 22 fully generated presentations and strict generated-fresh packing 2. Attributed original subtask remains outside generated freshness | Pending exact handling |','| Decks | 19 / 20 / 17 marks. The symbolic deck’s D0 14→19 is principal 2→3 plus implicit gradient-only 5→extended 9 | Pending compositions |','| Marking | OD-6 settled: one eligible first-use A/B deduction, A/B follow-through, normal M/DM. R1 valid constant-sign alternative; false-root no-change 3/4; primitive-based R5. See every scoped adaptation below | Pending exact application |','| Capabilities and gaps | APP8227-01–08 acceptance requirements; G09 given geometric diagrams remains untested in this pilot, with no capability hold | Pending acceptance requirements |','| Source policy | Textbook originals internal; NSSCAS/Cambridge originals attributed; held originals never anchors | Existing authority; exact candidate handling pending |','','## Adaptation, interpretation and decision register','','Every row has a status class. Final approval covers all active proposed adaptations and interpretations, regardless of status-class wording, only within their stated scope; settled owner decisions, source interpretations, and historical/withdrawn entries are distinguished. Structured equivalent: `d3/deviation-register.json`. The exact 4+2 motion tariff is proposed; the log domain was reviewer-prescribed, not owner-fixed.','','| ID / status class / state | Recipe and part | Official row or anchor | Departure or interpretation | Rationale |','|---|---|---|---|---|']
for row in rows:
 cells=[row['id']+'; '+row['status_class']+'; '+row['status'],row['recipe']+' / '+row['part'],row['official_row'],row['departure'],row['rationale'].replace('Apply3','Apply 3').replace('all27','all 27')]
